  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Nepal Local Governance Support Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To improve governance and services at the local level in Nepal, benefitting 2 million households. This includes introducing simple anti-corruption measures (e.g. public audits)  and providing the poorest and most excluded with tools to build their confidence to voice demands and hold officials to account. Parts of the programme will also ensure that Local Government&apos;s awareness and capacity on climate change adaptation, disaster resilience and environmentally friendly governance is improved.</narrative>
  </description>
